id: barrier
name: Barrier
uaType: both
prerequisite: Force or Magic Score of 4+
tpCost: 15
type: counter
actionCost: 1
kiCostPerTier: 10
# "When you are hit by an Attacking Maneuver" - a button on the attack's card once it has hit and before its Wound
# Roll, as the Block Maneuver's is (chat.mjs barrierStage). Its own Wound Roll, Simple Profile, any Foundation.
barrier: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Counter when hit: your own Wound Roll (Simple Profile, any Foundation), and the Damage you take is that much
  less.
text: >
  Barrier: You create a shield of some sort around you, protecting yourself from harm.
  –Ability Type: Technical/Magical
  –Prerequisites: Force or Magic Score of 4+
  –TP Cost: 15
  –KP Cost: 10(T)
  –Maneuver Type: Counter
  –Action Cost: 1 Counter Action
  –Minions: N/A
  –Passive Bonus: N/A
  –Effect: When you are hit by an Attacking Maneuver, make a Wound Roll as if you made an Attacking Maneuver of the
  Simple Profile (any Foundation). Reduce the Damage you receive by the Dice Score.
